ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >A duck who\u2019s definitely not supposed to be here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of aliens who didn\u2019t <i>expect</i> a duck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D, 3D and a whole lot of \u201cwait, what just happened?\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill Capybara that sells caps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q to QUACK! a dedicated quack button (you\u2019re welcome)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/d62957d7374fe51273667137dd10aa26.poster.avif?t=1755500575\" width=700 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/d62957d7374fe51273667137dd10aa26.webm?t=1755500575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/d62957d7374fe51273667137dd10aa26.mp4?t=1755500575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
